cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper."
title: "slmcal: Bayesian calibration workflow for shoreline models"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible workflow for the Bayesian calibration of shoreline evolution
  models, combining NSGA-II multi-objective pre-calibration to build informative
  site-specific priors with PyMC sampling through a black-box forward model.
authors:
